00:10:04.660 --> 00:10:07.900
So knowing what I know now that
I've been at Google for a while

00:10:07.900 --> 00:10:10.570
and kind of going back and
trying to fix that, it just

00:10:10.570 --> 00:10:13.360
so happens that the
container I had used

00:10:13.360 --> 00:10:16.360
