00:11:02.180 --> 00:11:05.450
drip bits of data with a
bunch of open connections.

00:11:05.450 --> 00:11:06.350
Let it warm up.

00:11:06.350 --> 00:11:07.220
All right.

00:11:07.220 --> 00:11:08.459
So we did it.

00:11:08.459 --> 00:11:09.750
So I'm going to open a new tab.

00:11:09.750 --> 00:11:10.333
And let's see.

00:11:10.333 --> 00:11:13.850
If I go to cats.jbeckwith.com--

00:11:13.850 --> 00:11:15.500
I've never given a
