00:11:17.270 --> 00:11:21.230
[LAUGHS] This is new for me.

00:11:21.230 --> 00:11:22.151
We did it!

00:11:22.151 --> 00:11:22.650
[LAUGHTER]

00:11:22.650 --> 00:11:25.730
I was able, with a
simple Bash script,

00:11:25.730 --> 00:11:27.350
